From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The Playport authors <dev@playport.dev>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 23:59:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] win32u-unix: port the iOS replacements onto wine-11.18

Three-way merge of each *_ios.c (base: the file at madeira-lgpl, theirs: the
file at wine-port-11.18). class: upstream moved class data into server shared
memory and dropped is_winproc_unicode; the per-PEB builtin winproc registry and
the bounded class_list walk sit on upstream's code (is_local_class, fnid).
driver: upstream's nulldrv client surface replaced ours; window_surface_funcs
now carries .size; send_hardware_message is server_send_hardware_message.
winstation: top_window is an HWND.

Class: madeira-port
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-09-26-wine-latest-rebase.md
Offered-upstream: no
